Subject: [PATCH] fix(chat): a plan told early as a step goes when the reply
 tells it (48247)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Thread 46960: the plan went out twice, 11 s apart. The model's in-between
text after propose_task_plan was saved as a step („ნიკოს, გიას, ლევანის და
დავითის ასისტენტებს დაველაპარაკები … დავიწყო?"), and the final reply told the
plan again in other words — so dropStepsTheReplyRepeats, which matches words,
could not see it. When the stored reply carries the plan sentence, the run's
steps that carry it too are dropped (best-effort, after the existing tidy-up).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
